WEBVTT

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:05.541
[♪ wistful music playing]

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:50.583
[♪ exhilarating music playing]

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.958
Let's play some hockey!

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.125
[audience cheering]

00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:34.125
This is Joy, coming to you
live in Riley's mind,

00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:37.000
and we are expecting
a great championship today

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:38.875
-with the Foghorns.
-[girls chuckle]

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:40.958
Riley fans,
get up on your feet,

00:01:41.041 --> 00:01:43.875
and make some noise!

00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:45.375
Go, go, go!

00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:48.291
-[all] Let's go, Foghorns!
-[rhythmic hand claps]

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:50.125
Bring it in!

00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:51.458
Foghorns on three.

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.333
-One, two, three...
-[all] Foghorns!

00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:54.416
[referee blows whistle]

00:01:58.625 --> 00:01:59.791
[players grunting]

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:01.291
[Riley panting]

00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:06.416
Now, it's time to greet
your Team Riley!

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.916
Playing in his 13th year,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.666
and fresh from
the penalty box,

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.750
it's Riley's Anger!

00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:13.666
Let me at 'em! [roars]

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.875
[growls]

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:17.000
-[Riley growling]
-[players grunting]

00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:19.791
-[all cheering]
-Whoo!

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:22.833
Helmet, pads, gloves,

00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:25.166
safety checklist is complete.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.166
It should be nothing
but smooth sailing from...

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.875
[screams] Look out!

00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:29.958
[Riley grunts]

00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:32.416
And that's Fear,
keeping Riley on her toes.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.750
We gotta get
our mouth guard, people.

00:02:36.291 --> 00:02:38.291
No, no, no! That's not ours!

00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:39.916
-[gags]
-And that, folks,

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.833
-is the infamous Disgust.
-[Disgust gagging]

00:02:41.916 --> 00:02:43.250
Glad to have her on our team.

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:45.333
-[player grunts]
-[whistle blows]

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:47.833
Twenty-eight.
Andersen, tripping.

00:02:47.916 --> 00:02:49.208
-[Sadness] Oh, no...
-[audience exclaiming]

00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:50.875
And bringing up the rear,

00:02:50.958 --> 00:02:52.625
you know her, you love her,

00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.541
the one, the only...

00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:57.125
Oh... We got a penalty.

00:02:57.583 --> 00:02:58.583
-[Sadness crying]
-That's right,

00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:00.791
Sadness is in the house!

00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:01.958
Yay...

00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:03.916
[female announcer]
Andersen goes to the box.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.375
Two minutes for tripping.

00:03:05.458 --> 00:03:07.208
[Joy] Okay, looks like
we have a couple of minutes

00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:09.125
while Riley takes a breather.

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:10.208
Let me catch you up.

00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.166
Riley is still exceptional.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.333
[Riley] Ta-da!

00:03:14.416 --> 00:03:15.500
Oh. Yum.

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:17.083
[Joy] And not just because
she's the top

00:03:17.166 --> 00:03:18.166
-of her class...
-Riley Andersen.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.750
[Joy]
...which, by the way, she is.

00:03:19.833 --> 00:03:21.166
Riley, Riley, over here!

00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.708
[Joy] She's also really kind,

00:03:23.791 --> 00:03:25.916
and she's nice to stray cats.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.125
I mean, come on.

00:03:27.458 --> 00:03:28.791
Oh, and she's officially

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.208
-a teenager now.
-[parents cheering]

00:03:30.375 --> 00:03:32.208
[Joy]
She got very tall, very fast.

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.125
[Anger] Did we grow overnight?

00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:37.000
[Sadness] Oh.
That was our favorite shirt.

00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:40.541
[Joy] We even got braces
with extra rubber bands!

00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:42.291
-[dentist] How does it feel?
-Great!

00:03:42.375 --> 00:03:43.708
-[dentist] Ow!
-Sorry.

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:45.625
[Joy] Riley's
Personality Islands

00:03:45.708 --> 00:03:47.416
are still going strong.

00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:50.166
Glad to see Boy Band Island
finally broke up.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.083
But Goofball is still
monkeying around. [laughs]

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.750
Wait, where's Family Island?

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:56.250
It's right there.

00:03:57.291 --> 00:03:59.375
[Sadness] Oh, there it is.

00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:01.416
What's that blocking it?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.875
[Joy]
Oh, that's Friendship Island.

00:04:02.958 --> 00:04:04.333
Isn't it amazing?

00:04:04.416 --> 00:04:06.333
But we realized her islands

00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:08.833
aren't the only things
made by memories.

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:10.750
Way down, at the root level,

00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:14.125
these memories
were also creating beliefs.

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:16.125
[Riley echoing]
Homework should be illegal.

00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:17.500
[groaning]

00:04:17.583 --> 00:04:20.666
[echoing] Get Up and Glow
is the best band ever!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.583
[Joy]
And my personal favorite...

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.250
[Riley echoing]
I'm a really good friend.

00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:27.125
Did you know
the change in your couch

00:04:27.208 --> 00:04:29.166
could change the world?
Oh, no!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.666
-[children exclaiming]
-[coins clinking]

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.708
[children laughing]

00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:35.041
Oh, no,
we should do something.

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.166
No!
That girl is a social Titanic.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.875
-Do not get on that ship.
-[Fear] Uh...

00:04:38.958 --> 00:04:40.166
Guys...

00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:41.916
-[gasps]
-Wow.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.250
[all gasping]

00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:45.583
[Joy] That is so pretty.

00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:46.708
[children chuckling]

00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:51.666
It's okay.
I drop things all the time.

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:56.875
I'm Riley.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:58.791
I'm Grace.

00:04:59.708 --> 00:05:00.750
I'm Bree.

00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:03.708
[Joy] Turns out, when you put

00:05:03.791 --> 00:05:04.833
all of those
beliefs together,

00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:07.416
they make the most wonderful
thing of all.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.125
Her Sense of Self.

00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:11.041
[Riley echoing]
I'm a good person.

00:05:11.208 --> 00:05:13.875
[Joy] It's what helps Riley
make good choices.

00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:16.333
Thirteen years of hard work,

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.666
all wrapped up in what some
might call our masterpiece.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:21.791
You know, one of the hardest

00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:22.875
-challenges we found...
-[buzzer sounds]

00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:24.166
[Joy] Oh, my gosh!
We're back in the game.

00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:26.750
[Sadness gasps] We're tied.

00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:28.166
How are we gonna score
in time?

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.666
[Fear] Oh!
We use our slap shot!

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.708
No, no, no.
We charge the goalie!

00:05:31.791 --> 00:05:33.875
But Grace hasn't scored yet.

00:05:35.916 --> 00:05:37.125
Riley's got this.

00:05:40.291 --> 00:05:41.958
Thread the needle!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.666
Come on, Riley.

00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:46.291
[player grunts]

00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:47.500
[audience cheering]

00:05:48.541 --> 00:05:49.541
-[grunts]
-[players clamoring]

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:51.083
[Riley panting]

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:54.125
[player grunts]

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:56.916
[panting]

